@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Liet ke bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai hop le - 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200583",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Dtc245200583/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Thieu thong tin nop bai - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Nop vao bai tap da dong - 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200583",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Dtc245200583/CNTTK23D"
}
